%% Sequence — sending a chat message with a file
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Sender
  participant UI as Web app
  participant API as Chat API
  participant AV as Malware scanner
  participant FS as Object storage
  participant DB as Database
  participant RT as Realtime (WebSocket)
  actor B as Recipient

  A->>UI: Attach file (PDF, ≤ 5 MB) + text
  UI->>API: POST /conversations/{id}/messages
  API->>DB: Sender active? not suspended? not blocked by recipient? member of group? group not closed?
  alt Not allowed
    API-->>UI: 403 with reason
  else Allowed
    API->>API: Check type whitelist and size
    API->>FS: Store file (private)
    API->>AV: Scan
    AV-->>API: Clean
    API->>DB: Insert message (encrypted body, purge_after = semester end + 12 months)
    API-->>UI: Sent ✓
    API->>RT: Publish to conversation channel
    RT-->>B: New message
    B-->>RT: Delivered
    RT-->>UI: Delivered ✓✓
    B->>API: Open conversation
    API->>DB: seen_at = now
    RT-->>UI: Seen
  end
  Note over A,B: Chat is never emailed, browser notification only if allowed
